sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 学生
  participant UI as /assistant
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant O as Supervisor
  participant T as Tool Registry
  participant LLM as Provider
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>UI: 输入学习目标或问题
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/agent/tasks
  API->>O: 创建 LangGraph 任务
  O->>LLM: 规划与选工具
  O->>T: 调用检索/资源/练习等
  T->>DB: 读写 Wiki/画像/日志
  O->>API: 步骤事件 SSE
  API->>UI: 流式展示
  O->>UI: 最终回答与产物
